{"key":"38bbc4673f50f098","source_file":"Potts Fl - Fu.json","source_id":12502,"source_url":"concordance-fold-ppl-plicare","term":"Fold","headwords":["Fold","Folding"],"latin":["Plicare","Complicare","Plicatio"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Fold"],"latin":["Plicare","Complicare"]},{"english":["Folding"],"latin":["Plicatio"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["SE","TCR"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"371","subsection":"7"},"text":"The fibres folded together...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"3393","subsection":"end"},"text":"By the foldings of his body... thus foldable...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"3927","subsection":null},"text":"Grievous penalties of folding... They were then folded, or by foldings were broken and torn...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"4012","subsection":null},"text":"Occurs. SE 4087:end.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"4093","subsection":null},"text":"When I folded my hands I perceived that as it were I did not fold them, but another; and a certain person said that he felt himself folding his hands, instead of me.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"6093","subsection":"end"},"text":"They folded their lips at various angles... but in vain. See TCR 111:6.","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"fold-38bbc4","url":"/meta/potts/fold-38bbc4/"}